{"version":1,"content":"<p>Rockstar未來真的會把《俠盜獵車》的故事舞台設在美國之外嗎?近期這一話題引發了不少討論，尤其是《衞報》對Rockstar的專訪刊出後——工作室聯合主管羅布·納爾遜當時打趣道「凡事無絕對」。但在之後接受Eurogamer的另一場專訪時，不難看出這一可能性其實很低。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1588302.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T07:47:10.611962+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:13:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T07:40:31.447730+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T07:40:31.447730+00:00","content_hash":"517ccbb8c0cefa4cd99c9bda7e92fc961f344c95f3c050fd4fc914b5818a3760","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}